<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Silver Grant shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Silver Grant shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Silver Grant International Industries Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
</text>
